# Tool and run artifacts (added 2026-08-12)
# `*.err` and the stray zero-byte files came from accidental shell
# redirections -- a mistyped `2>&1` leaves a file literally named `0` or
# `Dict[str`. Ignored so they stop reappearing in `git status`.
*.err
graphify-out/
.graphify_*
.claude-flow/
.mcp.json
